    "content": "## 2. Remote and Hybrid Work Guidelines\nEmployees working in hybrid-eligible roles may work remotely up to 3 days per week. - **Core Collaboration Hours:** All employees, regardless of location, must remain accessible on Slack and email between 10:00 AM and 4:00 PM Eastern Standard Time (EST).",
